window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The god of death is coming for me.</p> <p>He watches me through the eyes of a violent wolf—one who believes I’m his fated mate.</p> <p>He’s cruel and vicious…to everyone other than me.</p> <p>I know I should run, but I can’t deny the longing for him stirring deep within me.</p> <p>Just when I allow myself to trust him, he reveals his true nature. Enveloping me in his deadly embrace, he seeks to claim my soul.</p> <p>Despite my aching desire for him, I’ve made a vow to myself. Only I will be the one to determine my fate.</p> <p>*** This is a new adult dark paranormal romance with some dark themes, schmexy, sinful gods, and wolves, and is best suited for ages 17 and over. Be warned: this is a slow burn enemies-to-lovers romance, and the steaminess factor does increase through the course of the series! ♥</p> <p>*** <i>Of Gods and Wolves </i>is set within the world of Azar, along with (in listening order) <i>Hitched, Darkblood Academy, Royally Hitched, Darkblood Prison, Wolfish, and Vampish,</i> but it's not necessary to listen to the other series first to enjoy this one.</p>"; 
